<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">2Ximaatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Ximaatoosas Xaafeez Nam7inth Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ximaatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Xim.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Ximaatoosas Xaafeez Nam7antho Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Galo</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Ximaatoosas xaafeez nam7antho kiitay, Phawuloosar wolla ootheezannee Phawuloosa kale maaddiza yelaga Ximaatoosana zoreez zora aykkeeza. Ye zorayis aafe qofay, «Garizhor miinggoday garkke» yeegiza. Ximaatoosa zorennee minthatho qaala ekkeezay, Yesuus Kiristtoosa bagga tuma markkattoday garkk Wonggile qaalannee kase Caaqo timirtta miinthii aykkoday garkke metonnee ixxo gaanggikokka tamaarssorannee Wonggile sabbakor miinggoday garkkesii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ximaatoosa cere boozetith palamapp haakkoday garkk duma mino zore ees inggintteeza. Yey garkk oday as dhabisizapp attin akkokka maaddooya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ye ubbayid Ximaatoosa akaakkodayis beezizay, Phawuloosa hannanne e yessa yeykka, e ammano, e garzho, e siiqo, e miinthetithannee eza helleez meta aaziso udii kaalloday garkke. Phawuloosa fa laaso haasii yhayiqos giigintteez wode yha kiita xaafeeza.</para>
  <para style="iot">2 Ximaatoosa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ximaatoosas inggintteez zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3—2:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssith wode bagga <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2:14—4:5</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa hanii yez yessay <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Xooss shener, Yesuus Kiristtoosapp bentteez de7o ufayssapp dendeezayid Yesuus Kiristtoosas hawaare maaqqeez Phawuloosapp, <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>ta dosiza na7a Ximaatoosas;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Xooss Adayppenne nu Goda Kiristtoosa Yesuusappe aadho keehetithii, maarotithinnee sarotithi maaqqo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Haw. O. 16:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximaatoosas inggintteez zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Taanii, ta woosayid qammannee gallas nena qoppiza. Taanii woossiza wode ta aditay garkk ta lo77o kahar eesi oothiza Xoossa ne gishos galatiza. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Taanii ne afutha qoppiza; nena bi7ii ufayttizana gaame laamotiza.<verse eid="2TI 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Ma nees yez tuma ammana ta eriza. Ye ammanay binii ne wogga indat Loydirannee ne indat Ewuniqes yez ammanay garkke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Haw. O. 16:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Yeyi gishos, taanii ta kushayid neell afa gaddeez wode Xoossii nees inggeez imota neenii mahii eethoday garkk ta nena qofisiza. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Abis giiko, Xoossii nuus wolqqa, siiqonnee nu ubba haariza Geeshsha Ayyana inggeezapp attin yashsha ayyana inggekkaya.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Yikkee, nu Godayis markkattodayis yeelatippe; ma e gishos accintteez ta baggarakka yeelatippe. Zini Xoossii nees inggiza wolqqar Wonggile gishos taar meto ekkoba. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Xoossii fa shenerannee fa aadho keehetithayir nuna dummasii, fa geeshsha woya udodayis nuna dooreezapp attin nuunii ootheez ooso gishos baaya. Yha aadho keehatitha Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar alame medhinttodaypp tiin nuus inggeeza. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Yhatti yha aadho keehetithay nuna ashshiza Kiristtoos Yesuusa yi7ithayir bentteeza. E yhayiqo wolqqa dhabisii, Wonggile baggar yhayqqoowa de7o nuus qoncciseeza.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Taanii Wonggile sabaake, hawaarennee asitamaare maaqqod garkk Xoossii taas mawute inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:7">1 Xim. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Taanii yey gishos yha meta ekkiza; zin ta ammaneezay oonazako eriza gishos yeellataamii. Taas inggintteez hadara Yesuusa maaqqii ye7od gallasay hellodayis E naagodayis danda7izana ta eriza.<verse eid="2TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Taanii nena taamarsseez tuma qaala aaziso oosa aykkii Kiristtoosa Yesuusar yez ammanayirannee siiqayir yezoba. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Nu gancce yez Geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar nees inggintteez lo77o hadara naagoba.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Iisa Awurajja yez ubbay taapp haakkeezana ne eriza; u gancce Figeluusarannee Hermmogeneesara yeza.<verse eid="2TI 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Anesfoora tana unddenna wode minthatheez gishos Goday e kara asayis qadhintto. Taanii achch kara yez wode E ta achchayidakka yeellatekkaya. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Yeyil afa E Oroome katama ye7eezan garkk tana miinthii koy denggeeza. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Wurssith gallas Goday ees qadhinttoday garkk taanii Goda woosiza. Efesoona katama yez wode E tana ab garkk maaddeezako ne loythii eriza.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuus Kiristtoosas ammanintteez wottadare maaqqith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Yikkee, ta na7ayyo, Kiristtoosa Yesuusar yez aadho kehetithyir mingoba. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Gaame markkittithar tiina taanii nena taamarsseez timirtta, hara tamaarssodayis danda7iza ammanintteez asayis hadara inggoba.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosas lo77o wotaaddare maaqqii taar wolla meto ekkoba. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Wotaaddare fana azazeez fa halaqa ufayssodayis giiginttizaypp attin hara oosor fana gitooya. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Yey garkkekka, aalaalo woxxiza oonkka higgayis beeziza oger woxxaam ixxiko gamith woyito ekkooya. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Biita wootar daaburiza ooso athay fa daabura aafaypp miiz tiina as maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Goday ubbabazar nees akaaka inggod gishos ta nees odeezibazana ne wozinayid naagoba.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Taanii markkattiz Wonggilay yhaya, yhayiqoppe denddeez, Dawute zerethi maaqqeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa qoppoba. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Taanii Wonggile odiza gishos daafa ootheez as garkk, accinttii meto ekkeeza. Zini Xooss qaalay accinttoya. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Yeyi gishos, Xoossii maraxeez asitay Kiristtoosa Yesuusapp dengeez atotithay baggar medhina bonchcho ekkoday garkk u gishos ubba bazar ta waayiza.<verse eid="2TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Yay garkk yeegiz qaalay ammanintteezaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«Nuunii ezar yhayqqeez baz maaqqiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">ezar wolla de7or yezoda.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Nuunii garzhor nu minggiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ezar wola kawutoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Nuunii eza kaddiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ezikka nuna kaddoda.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Nuunii ammaninttaam ixxiko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat. 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Luq. 12:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">E ammanintteezaya maaqqii yezoda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">Abis giiko, E fana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">kaddodayis danda7ooya» yeegiza.<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mino oosanchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Neenii unttan yhaya qopisoba; u qaalaypp dendeezayid palamaamay garkk, Xooss tiina unttan zoroba. Yeyi si7izita dhabisizapp attin akkokka maaddooya. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Neenii tuma qaala luuletithar tamaarssizannee yeellathoowa ooso as maaqqii, Xoossar dosintteez as garkk, nenatitha ees inggodayis minggoba. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Zini yha alamayis haniza maaddoowa balbuqqith odaypp haakkoba. Yey garkk oday as Xoossapp haakithiza. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Yey garkk timirttay asetithi mi haasiz citto kixxa garkke. Yey garkk oda odinttizitay ganccepp Hemenoosarannee Filixoosar yeza. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Yha asitay tuma oga ashshii, «Yhayqqeez asay yhayiqoppe binii denddeeza» yeegii pettii pettii asitay ammana dhabiseeza.<verse eid="2TI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Hano zin, «Goday Ees maaqqeezita eriza» ubbarakk «Goday sunth xeegiz oonkka iita oosopp haakko» yeegiz maatamer yez eni7oowa Xooss baasay miinggii yezoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Tay. 16:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Pettii damma keetha worqqapp woy birapp oosintteez miishe aadda baazin mithappennee zhiice biittapp oosintteez miishitaiykka yeza. Yeyititaypp baggitay bonchcho oosos, ma baggitay tooshinttiza oosos peezhiza. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Yeyi gishos, oonkka iita ubba ashshikonnee fana geeshshiko, bonchcho ooso oothiza miishe maaqqoda. U yessay geeshshinnee Goda ufayssiz abaz, ma unttii lo77o ooso ubba oothodayis danda7izita maaqqoda.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Na7atith iita amotithappe haakkoba. Geeshsha wozinar Goda xeegiz asayir pettipp, xillotithi, ammano, siiqonnee sarotith kaalloba.<verse eid="2TI 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Zini kachi medhdhizana erii boozetithinnee cere palamapp haakkoba. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Goda oosanchchay as ubbayis keeha, lo77o tamaarssizannee danda7anchcho maaqqodayis beezizapp attin kaccinttodayis beezooya. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>E paar eqinttizita ashikketithar seeriza maaqqodayis beeziza. Unttii fa nagaraypp maaqqii tuma eroday garkk Xoossii oothodazakko oonii ere. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Unttii fa wozinako maaqqii fa shene udod garkk unttan aykkeez Xalahe xikaypp buuttoda.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith gallas hanod iita bazita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Wurssith gallas un77ithiza wode ye7odana eroba. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Asay fana dosizita, miishe dosizita, ceeqinttizita, utirttizita, cazhizita, fana yeleezitayis kiitinttoozita, galatoozita, geeshshetithii baazita, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>siiqo baazita, maaroozita, zigirizita, fana haaroozita, qadhe baazita, lo77o dosoozita, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>kaddizita, ellisizita, utirar dafinttizita, Xoossapp aathii asho ufayssodayis dosizita maaqqoda. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Unttii Xooss goyinizita aazizapp attin E wolqqa kaddizita; neenii yey garkk asaypp haakkoba.<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Unttapp pettay pettay as kara zurqqinttii gelii gaame nagara doorintteezitannee duma duma amor xuuginttiz ayyana daabureez maachita balithizitay garkke. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Ye maachita ubba wode taamarssiza, zin tuma erodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Yaanesannee Yambbareesa Muser eqinttteezay garkk yha asitay kaha oothoozitannee ammanor daabureez asita maaqqeez gishos tumar kaazinttiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kes. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Zini Iyaanesannee Iyambireesa boozetithay qoncceezay garkk u boozetithaykka as ubbay tiina qonccod gishos unttis hanena.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Zini neenii ta timirtta, ta yessa, ta qofa, ta ammana, ta danda7a, ta siiqa, ta garzha, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>ta bayi7inttithannee ta meta ne eriza. Anxooka, Iqonoone, Lisxira katamitayid tana hellezbazinnee taanii danda7eez meta ne eriza; Goday tana ye ubbaypp ashsheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">Haw. O. 13:14-52</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:1-20">14:1-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Kiristtoosa Yesuusar Xooss ufayssiza yess yezodayis koyiz ubbay bayi7inttoda. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Iita asaynnee balithizitay paas balinttittarannee harita balithittar kaseesaypp aathii iitittar iitittar yhammada.<verse eid="2TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Zini ne tamaareezayidannee ne ammaneez tumayid miinggii eqqoba. Ne oopp tamaareezako ne eriza. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Neenii ne na7atithapp aykkii Kiristtoosa Yesuusa ammanii atotithi denggiz ecetithi inggodayis danda7iza Geeshsha Maxaafita taamarii ereeza. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Geeshsha Maxaafe ubbay Xooss Ayyana xaafod baz inggin xaapintteez qaala. Ya maxaafay tuma tamaarssodayis, balintteezita seerodayis, buuta luulisodayisnnee xillotith yessis koshshiza baz zorodayis maaddiza. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Xooss asii polonnee lo77o ooso ubbayis giigintteeza maaqqoday garkk maaddiza.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Taanii nena Xooss tiina, pathi yezitayllannee yhayqqeezitayill pirddodayis yez Kiristtoosa Yesuusa tiina e qonccithayirannee e kaatetithayir zoriza. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Qaala sabbakoba; wode giigin giigekka attin miinggii markkatoba. Gaame danda7arannee tamaarssor asa zoroba, seerii luulisobannee denthithoba. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Asay tuma timirtte si7aam ixxod wode ye7oda. Unttii fa amo kaallii, paas si7odayis ufayssiza baz odiz asitamaarita shiishoda. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Unttii tuma bagga odiz timirtte ashshii, tuma maaqqekka oda si7odayis fa haye mahoda. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Zini neenii ubba bazar naaginttoba. Meto danda7oba. Wonggile markkattitha ooso udoba. Nees inggintteez Xooss ooso ubba poloba.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Taanii yarshsho yarshshizay garkk yarshshinttodayis woday helleeza; yha alama ashshii yhanigiza woday helleeza. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Taanii lo77o ola olintteeza; ta aalaalo laasa haaseeza; ammana naageeza. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Yhaypp guyes xillotithi zawude<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Xillotitha zawuday: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xillotitha yez gishos ta ekkod zawude. Xillotithii taas zawude udii inggiza guussii.</char></note> tana naagiza. Yeya geeshsha pirdda pirddiz Goday ye gallas taas inggoda. Yeyi ta aaddas baazin E maaqqii yi7itha amottiz ubbayis inggoda.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa buzo qofita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Ellissii taako ye7odayis minggoba. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Deemaasa yha alama dosii, tana ashshii, Teselonqqe katama qiteeza. Qerqisima Galaatiya, Titonnee Dilmmaaxa biitta qiteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Qol. 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:23">2 Qor. 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal. 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:4">Tito 1:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luqaasa aadda taar yeza. Marqqoosa Xooss oosor tana maaddodayis danda7iza gishos neer ekkii ye7oba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Qol. 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Haw. O. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Qol. 4:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Taanii Tikiqoosana Efesoona katama kiiteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Haw. O. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efi. 6:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Qol. 4:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Neenii yi7ittar, Xiro7aada katama Karppoosa lanqqe ashshii ye7eez ta kootannee maxaafita taas ekkii ye7oba. Ubbayppekka xaath maxaafita ekkekkazar yi7ippe.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Xarqqimaale oothiz Iskkinddire tana iita qoheeza; Goday e oosay garkk ees ciggoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1 Xim. 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz. 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Oro. 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>E nu timirtta ixxiza gishos eepp nena naagoba.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Tiina ta mootintteez wode ubbay ashshii qitteezapp attin oonkka tana maaddekkaya. Xoossii ye buuta unttis taybippe. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Zini taanii kunth kiita Ayihude baa as ubbayis markkatin, unttii si7odayis garkk Goday ta kantta eqqii taas wolqqa inggeeza. Ma gaammo garkk doona dooyeez yhayiqopp tana asheeza. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Goday tana iita ubbaypp ashshii salo kaatetith saror hellithoda. Ees medhinapp medhina hellodayis bonchcho maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Phirisqilas, Aqiilasinnee Anesifoora kara asayis ta sarotha helthoba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Haw. O. 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16-17">2 Xim. 1:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erasxoosa Qoronttoosa katama atteeza. Xirofimoosa harggintteez gishos Millixe katama eza ashsheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Haw. O. 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Oro. 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Haw. O. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Barigo gelodaypp tiina ellisii ye7oba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ewubuloosa, Phudeesa, Linoosa, Qilaadennee hara ammaniza asitay ubbay nena saro saro giza.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa neer maaqqo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Xooss aadho keehetithay yinttar ubbayir maaqqo.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
